Added a Playwright-based end-to-end testing framework as the forward standard for browser-based test coverage: shared page-object and fixture infrastructure in `nautobot/e2e/`, per-app test suites under `nautobot/<app>/tests/e2e/`, an optional `e2e` dependency group, an `invoke e2e` task, and an `e2e-test` CI job. The Locations list view filter Selenium test was replaced by its Playwright equivalent.
